Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ In the white room ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ With black curtains ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Near the station ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Black roof country ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ No gold pavements ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Tired starlings ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Silver horses ran down moonbeams ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ In your dark eyes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第三季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome back to Clarkson's Farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎回到克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the middle of August in 2022.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是2022年8月中旬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're welcome. Thanks. Where have you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不客气 谢谢 你是哪里人?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And everything seems to be familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一切似乎都很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And bucolic...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}洋溢着田园风光...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且精彩绝伦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'm afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但恐怕幕后的情况 一点都不美妙 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}behind the scenes, it isn't wonderful at all, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything that could go wrong has gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有可能出问题的地方都出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第17集 非耕地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's start with the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们从天气开始说起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After the driest summer for 87 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在经历了87年来最干旱的夏季之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the ground is parched and as hard as concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}地面干裂 像混凝土一样坚硬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as a result, the crops are taking a battering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 庄稼遭受重创
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So trying to grow potatoes where there's no moisture...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们试着在干旱的土地里种土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, the skin's set. So it's not gonna grow anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是成熟期的土豆 它不会再长了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“成熟期”是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, new potatoes, if you did that you'd rub the skin off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}新长出来的土豆 如果你这么摸土豆的皮 会把皮擦掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Like a Jersey Royal? - Like a Jersey Royal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就像泽西皇家土豆一样?是啊 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But these have now set their skin to stop them losing moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在 它的皮牢牢地粘附着 以阻止其水分流失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So that's as big as it's gonna get? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它就只能长这么大了?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb had a go at harvesting these potato pebbles,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布试着采收 这些鹅卵石大小的土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it was hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但非常失败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I'm just dropping them all, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 土豆全都掉了 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The potatoes are that small, they're falling between the rollers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土豆太小了 会从滚轮之间掉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just dropping them on the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就掉到了地面上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the next field along, the sunflowers were suffering too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在旁边的田地里 向日葵也出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look. It's coming to the end of August.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经到八月底了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These flowers have gotta mature, ripen, in time for us to harvest them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些向日葵必须成熟 这样我们才能及时采摘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, is this seed ready? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这葵花籽已经熟了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's useless. - We won't be able to harvest these?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没 完全没用 - 我们没法采摘这些向日葵?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's pointless. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}白种了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真糟心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Next, there was the echium,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来 蓝蓟 一种植物性鱼油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a sort of plant-based fish oil
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which I'd been told would net me a fortune if it grew well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人跟我说 如果它长得好 我就能大赚一笔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not a lot, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不多啊 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's just the... That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是...那...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One field of spelt wheat produced that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一块斯佩耳特小麦田的产量是那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One field of echium has produced... that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一块蓝蓟田的产量就这么点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The dryness of the soil also meant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤干燥还意味着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that planting next year's oilseed rape was a non-starter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明年收获的油菜籽也没法种了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look. Oh God, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你看!天啊 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went down a foot the other day. There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天我挖到地下30公分的地方 什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if we try and drill rape into that, it's not gonna grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果我们把油菜条播进去 它没法生长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On top of all this, there was the pretty little restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了这些问题 还有在夏季初开业的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we'd opened earlier in the summer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}售卖我们在农场里种植的作物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to sell the food we'd grown and reared on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和驯养的动物的漂亮小餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheers, guys. - Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干杯 各位 - 干杯 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But after just six weeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但仅仅在六周后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关门通知
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The council served us with an enforcement notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}议会给我们送来了 一份强制执行通知书
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}telling us it had to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我们必须关闭餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome, everybody. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎各位 你们好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm particularly proud of the durum wheat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种硬质小麦让我特别自豪 因为这种作物通常生长在意大利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause it normally grows in Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everyone looks very full. More brisket?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大家看起来都很饱了 - 还要牛胸肉吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢大家过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Enforcement notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}强制执行通知
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"What you are required to do within six weeks of the date
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“在此通知生效之日起的六周内
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on which this notice comes into effect."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你需要做到以下事项
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Cease use of any part of the land for sale or provision
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“停止在该土地的任何地方 向公众出售或提供食物或饮品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of food or drinks to members of the public
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“或让公众在该土地上消费
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or for consumption on the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cease use of any part of the land as a restaurant or a café."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“停止将该土地的任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though we're allowed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“用作餐厅或咖啡厅” 即使我们有权这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Cease use of any part of the land for parking."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“停止将该土地的任何地方 用作停车场”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Reinstate the land round the restaurant to a condition
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“将餐厅周围的土地恢复到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}similar to that of the agricultural land immediately surrounding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“与其周围的农业用地相似的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}removing all hardcore and other surfacing materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“清除所有地基碎石和其他表面材料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}including gravel and stone chippings."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“包括砂砾和碎石”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why you can't have gravel on a farm, I don't know. But anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么农场不能有砂砾啊? 我不理解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Removing all other landscaping materials, including wooden sleepers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但无论如何 “移除所有其他景观材料
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- wooden plank edging and wood chippings."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“包括木枕、木板边条和木屑...”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The wood chip's just gonna rot. - I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}木屑会腐烂的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've gone completely mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们彻底疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Removing all plants and planting containers."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“移除所有植物和植物容器”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You can't have plant pots on a farm? Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 农场不能放植物盆 - 太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're going round and round in circles, wasting a lot of fucking good money...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一直在原地打转 浪费了一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Your money. Permanently. - Yes, and the tax payers'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}浪费的是你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有他们的钱 以及纳税人的钱...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, everybody's money is just being--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每个人都投了钱进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pissing it up against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后被白白浪费 这就是个笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a joke. All the effort we put in and we're back on square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的一切努力都是徒劳的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the restaurant shut down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}餐厅关门后 我们再也没钱养这些奶牛了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we could no longer afford to keep all the cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could hang onto the calves to fatten them up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以留着小牛 把它们养肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but their mums... would have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它们的妈妈必须离开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We bought 19. They had 8, so that's 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们之前买了19头 生了8头牛犊 所以总共是27头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Killed 2, 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杀了两头 还剩25头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Correct. - We're keeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - 我们留...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}12头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So 13 are going...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以要送走13头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thirteen passports I have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我这里有13张凭证
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dropping off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们赶上车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm finding today really quite sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得今天真的很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's 'cause for the last year, I've been opening the windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为去年 我早上打开窗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}opening the curtains in the morning, and there are the cows. And I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拉开窗帘就能看到奶牛 我很喜欢那种场景
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Making cow noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们哞哞叫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It just cheers my heart every morning to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天早上看到它们都让我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are the calves going to be a bit upset tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小牛今晚会不会伤心?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're not gonna sleep tonight. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会 你今晚别想睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They won't? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们会不睡吗? - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you won't sleep. They'll be calling all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是你会睡不着 它们会叫一整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Can I ask? Peppa's going, obviously. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我能问一下吗?显然胡椒也得离开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you think will become of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 你觉得它会怎样呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't ask too many questions about Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我是你 我不会问胡椒的去向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't ask questions you don't want to know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不要问你不想知道答案的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All we had left of the departed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只留下了 一些感人的手机视频回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was some touching phone-camera memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎手机视频
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不可以!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:30.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out of there. No, you too. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:30.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出来!你们俩!快离开那儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out! No, not my flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 别踩我的花!出去!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on, shoo. Shoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续走 嘘!嘘!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You too, shoo. Shoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你也是 嘘!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Cup of tea? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 要喝杯茶吗? - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not like we're not keeping a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们又不是一头没留 - 就是 我们留了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we've got quite a few. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be all the ones we gave birth to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把我们接生的都留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With more than half the herd gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着一半的牛群的离去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}my eco-friendly plan to get the cows and hens working in tandem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我那个利用奶牛和鸡 给土壤施肥的环保计划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to fertilise the soil was in tatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也流产了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Soil, look, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.56,0:08:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤 你看 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All good for the soil. New soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 土壤很不错 - 是啊 新土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but thanks to West Oxfordshire District Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但多亏了西牛津郡议会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we have to use chemicals from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们现在必须用化肥 - 是啊 用氮肥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We've got nitrogen. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, as Cheerful Charlie then explained,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正如开心的查理后来解释的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this was not the year to be buying chemical fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年化肥价格高 不适合购买
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've gotta be realistic about the projections for harvest '23.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对于2023年的预期收成 我们必须现实点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is the wheat price. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是小麦的价格 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you look at the blue line,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你可以通过蓝线看到 其峰值每吨超过350英镑...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where it peaked at over 350 pounds a ton...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it falling? - It's falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 价格在下降? - 在下降
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How's that happening? - The war's still going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 战争...这是怎么回事? - 现在还在打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's now down to 200... - It's now just under 250.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 现在已经降到200了 - 现在才不到250英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's dropped a hundred pounds a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以每吨跌了100英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know we've got fertiliser prices that have gone up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后化肥价格上涨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much did we pay for the fertiliser?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们买化肥花了多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just over 800 pounds a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一吨800多英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three times more than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是平时价格的三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three times. So that's gone up by three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三倍 所以总价增加了三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And wheat price has come... Oh fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小麦价格也随之...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So last year, we had low growing costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 去年 我们的生产成本很低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This year, if we buy the same amount of fertiliser,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年 如果我们购买等量的化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it'll be 100,000 pounds you need to spend on fertiliser alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那光买化肥就要花十万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's terrible. - Its...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be bad if the yields are poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果收成不好 情况可能会很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And also take gas price, fuel price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且还要考虑干燥谷物时的 油价、燃料价格、电费等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Energy in terms of drying the grain. Every way you turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每一步都困难重重...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Farming's exposed to energy price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农业会受能源价格影响
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not knowing what to do about Charlie's grim forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对于查理的悲观预测 我束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went off to see Viktor, our Ukrainian bee man...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我出发去见 我们的乌克兰养蜂人维克托
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Viktor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好啊 维克托 - 你好 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...who was loading up the hives
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他正在装蜂箱 这样我们 就可以提取最新一批蜂蜜了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we could extract the latest batch of honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of dead bees in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有很多死蜜蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah, well, unfortunate, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很不幸 对吧?就像顿巴斯战役一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's like battle of Donbas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many pounds of honey in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有多少蜂蜜?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would say roughly box ten kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一箱大概有10千克 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ten kilos? A box. About a 100 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 10千克? - 是的 一箱这么多 总共约100吨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That is... Oh! That is all honey! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那都是蜂蜜 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see the bulging on either side if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到两侧的凸起 你可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - That is just rammed full of honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 里面都填满了蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got a lot of honey! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好家伙 我们有很多蜂蜜 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the only thing on the farm that's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是农场里唯一成功的一环
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Literally the only thing that makes money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的是唯一赚钱的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After my Viktor chat, I had a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟维克托聊过以后 我有了一个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Diddly Squat is mainly an arable farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场以种植庄稼为主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but there must be other ways of making money beside the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但除了庄稼之外 一定还有别的赚钱方式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I put my thinking cap on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我一边仔细思考 一边和永远听话的狗狗一起散步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and went for a walk, with the ever-obedient dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟上 唉!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa! Arya! Heel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚 跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya! Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚 跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Sansa! Arya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sansa! Arya! Arya! Sansa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}珊莎、艾莉亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚、珊莎!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There may be a small wait now while they get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在可能要稍等一下 它们需要时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}having determined they can't catch the deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确定自己抓不住那头鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bambi, in case you're worried, is completely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家不必担心 小鹿斑比很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is what I call the Hedge of Plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是我所说的充足的树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's got so much stuff growing in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:12:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它里面长了很多东西 大概有800米长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It runs for half a mile or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's about 30 feet thick, as you can see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如你所见 大约九米厚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Full of berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}满是浆果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blackberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are sloe berries. Sloes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是野莓、黑刺李
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Elderflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接骨木花
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's elderflower, sloe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以有接骨木花、黑刺李
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rose hips, blackberries, apples, damsons, plums.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玫瑰果、黑莓、苹果、欧洲李、李子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After a little sit-down with my special thinking juice,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我拿着我的思考专用“果汁” 小坐片刻后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I started to form a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始制定计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just been thinking. This farm is a 1,000 acres,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚刚一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这座农场占地404公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I only farm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我只种了大约200公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about 500 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The other 500 are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外200公顷是树林 还有野花草地等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}woods and wildflower meadows and just stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the 500 acres I don't farm are full of berries and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我没种庄稼的 这200公顷土地上满是浆果...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and apples and watercress and wild garlic and deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有苹果、豆瓣菜、野蒜和鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I wonder if you could farm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我想知道是否可以耕种...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the unfarmed? I wonder if I could make money...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非耕地 我想知道我是否能利用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}out of the bit of the farm I'm not farming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有种庄稼的这部分农场赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Council couldn't stop that, could they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}议会不能阻止这种做法 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, they could try but they wouldn't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们可以尝试 但无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In my head, this was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我看来 这是一个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:29.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But making money from the woods and the meadows and the hedges
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但要利用树林、草地和树篱赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}would require a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要做大量的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I called a meeting with my number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我和我的二把手开了个会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got something serious to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有件严肃的事要对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've made a big decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我做了一个重大决定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are no longer the tractor driver on this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不再是这个农场的拖拉机司机了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What am I then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've decided I'm gonna make you farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定让你担任农场经理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Really? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的吗? - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want you to run the farming side of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想让你来负责经营农场方面的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? - You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.32,0:14:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, you can't fire... I'm the boss! - I'm the farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能解雇我...我是老板!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're fired. - I'm not fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是农场经理 你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我没被解雇 - 你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not, because you haven't heard how this is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 因为你还不知道 具体要怎么操作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tell me that, then you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你先告诉我 然后再被解雇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's how I want it to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望这么操作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got to concentrate this year on making money
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年 我必须集中精力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}out of that bit of the farm which isn't farmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}利用未种植作物的那部分农场赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes? - You've never even been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 你从没去过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then that means I'm not gonna have the time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就意味着我没时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to really concentrate on this bit of the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}集中精力管理农场的这部分区域
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the arable. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}耕地部分 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I'm gonna put you on the arable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我要让你来负责耕地部分
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm gonna concentrate on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我集中精力开发这部分
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And I've just had a thought. - Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我突然想到了一个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't we make it a competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不如我们比一场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who in the next 12 months can make the most money:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在接下来的12个月里 赚钱最多的人获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}me out of unfarmed land
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是管理未耕地的我 还是管理耕地的你?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- or you out of farmed land? - Farmed land... I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}耕地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:14:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we'll get a whiteboard, we'll put it on the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们要弄一块白板 放在墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then it's Jeremy's profit and costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后写上杰里米的利润和成本 卡莱布的利润和成本
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Kaleb's profit and costs. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay? And then it'll run through the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以吗?然后要记录全年的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think that'll be quite good fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得那会很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it'll be fun as well. And I'm gonna win, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我也觉得 反正我能赢 所以没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You aren't gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你赢不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna win this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会赢得这场比赛的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Get out and get back on your tractor and go manage the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出去吧 回到你的拖拉机上 去管理农场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't need to now. I'm gonna go have a nice walk round,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在不用开拖拉机了 我要愉快地散步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}anal-- "analasyse" the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“风”析土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Analasyse"? - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“风”析?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a word, innit? "Analasyse"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有这个词 对吧?“风”析
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No! -"Analasyse"! It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“风”析 就是这词 - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Analyse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是分析 - 分析
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Analyse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To get my "Farming the Unfarmed" project off the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了启动我的未耕地开发项目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did some research.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我进行了一些调查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And discovered that my local supermarket was charging 6p a blackberry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我发现当地的超市 卖的黑莓每个6便士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:16:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which meant my hedgerows were fruity gold mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:16:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我的树篱墙简直是水果金矿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look. 6p, 12, 24...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊!6便士 12、24...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's 50p there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这儿有50便士 又是50便士 那儿也有 还有那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Another 50p there, and there, and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A pound there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿是一磅 光是这个灌木丛 就能赚30英镑 轻轻松松
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's 30 quid in this one bush alone, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In order to maximise profits, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但为了让利润最大化
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd need to harvest them as cheaply as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要尽可能便宜地采摘黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So rather craftily I asked if I could borrow a blackberry-picking machine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 相当巧妙地 我问了下能否借一台黑莓采摘机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to see if I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看我到底喜不喜欢这机器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼 这比我预期的大了一些 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bit bigger than I was expecting, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 只大了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just a bit bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you? Erm... - I'm well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗? - 好 我很好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We've got the grain wagon. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有运粮车 我去让他倒个车
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just back him up. If you could pull over to the right, is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能不能把车靠到右边 可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, mate? Do you mind backing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}打扰一下 伙计?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that that wagon can get through and go over there? Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}介意倒下车吗? 这样那辆货车就能过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheers, mate. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以吗?谢了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm a car-park attendant, that's what I've become now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在成了停车场管理员了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm loading the lorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在给卡车装货
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, well, it was in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 可它挡路了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your farming is in the way of my farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你的农场经营妨碍了我的农场经营 - 这...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, your farming's getting in the way of my farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的农场经营妨碍了我的农场经营
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It isn't. I just need to get this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并没有!我只是需要把这车开进去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看那个 - 什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:20.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You don't even know what it is, do you? No... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你甚至都不知道那是什么 对吧? - 不知道 你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blackberry picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}采摘黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Load the wagon up and then come and see real farming happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不如等你装完车 来看看真正的农场经营吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Real" farming my arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真正的农场经营个鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Let my blackberry farming begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 开始我的黑莓采摘计划吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, the first thing I've realised is that my trailer is 25 yards wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我意识到的第一件事 是我的拖车车宽将近两米三
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I meet a bus coming the other way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果遇到对向行驶的公交车 那公交车司机会带着一台
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the bus driver is going to be going home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with a blackberry-picking machine fastened to his face like a moustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像胡子一样绑在脸上的 黑莓采摘机回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As you can probably see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们可能看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the blackberry-picking machine is like an arch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黑莓采摘机就像一个拱门
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm gonna try and harvest that hedge to start with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我会先试着 采摘那些树篱里的黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've gotta get my blackberry-picking machine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我要让我的黑莓采摘机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to straddle this wall first of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跨过这堵墙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This, inevitably, was easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不可避免地 说起来容易做起来难
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How on earth am I going to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我到底该怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没对准
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's just not possible, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这根本不可能做到 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was nothing for it. I had to ask my business rival for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样不行 我不得不向我的商业竞争对手求助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, you see that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你看到那个了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an arch. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:18:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 这是拱形的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:18:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you have to get that arch to straddle this wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须让这个拱形包住这堵墙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because we've gotta go all the way down this wall
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们必须沿着这堵墙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to get to where the blackberries are. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 开到黑莓所在的地方 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我能做到!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I bet he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, Kaleb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加油 卡莱布!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, we're on. We're hooked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 上去了 我们挂上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna go as straight as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会尽可能直着开过去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, there's a lot of fence... We're knocking all these fence posts off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有很多栅栏... 我们把所有这些栅栏弄掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The whole wall is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整面墙都在动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna be harvesting a wall if you're not careful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是你不小心作业的话 那我们会把墙给摘回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These blackberries better be profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些黑莓最好能盈利
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! That's blown the whole wall right out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它把整堵墙都弄塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, sheee. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.92,0:20:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much further until we get to what could be called...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还要开多远才能到所谓的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait. This wall doesn't fucking stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 等等 这堵墙没有尽头! - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This wall does not stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这堵墙没有尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to back up. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你得倒车 - 倒不了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you can't go forwards 'cause we now can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不能继续往前开了 因为我们现在看不见墙了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're fucked, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们完蛋了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ. Look what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 看我们做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What we'd done was harvest no blackberries at all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不仅一颗黑莓都没摘到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and create a week's work for Gerald, who wouldn't be able to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还给杰拉德增加了一周的工作量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可他没法干活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because he'd phoned that morning to say he wasn't feeling very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他那天早上打电话说他人不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stay where you are. That's it, stay straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}待在原地 就这样 别动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And rather embarrassingly, when the people came
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且尴尬的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to collect the precious demonstrator they'd lent me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等人来取回借给我的珍贵试用机时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to lift it off the wall using two telehandlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不得不用两台伸缩臂叉车 把它抬离墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's... that's the fence now broken again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更多栅栏掉了 那些栅栏又坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at the concrete. No, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看那混凝土 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here you are. Here's your machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了!这是你的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly, I now needed to think of a new way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我现在需要想一个新方法 来采摘我的黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to harvest my blackberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But first, it was my turn to help Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但首先 轮到我帮助卡莱布了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa. That's Kaleb's new muck spreader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是卡莱布的新施肥机
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because it was time to scoop up the muck
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为是时候清理最近送走的奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:22:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our recently departed cows had produced over the last 11 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.28,0:22:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在过去11个月里产生的粪便了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is pungent. That's good stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}味道真冲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那可是好东西!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So how much do you reckon is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你觉得这有多少? - 我觉得这儿大约200吨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I reckon we've got about 200 tonnes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}200 tonnes of faeces. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 200吨粪便 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 感觉一下 感受一下它的热度 - 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Feel how hot it is. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Feel the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉一下热度 感觉到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Can you feel it? - Oooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why is it so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么这么烫?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- When it ferments... - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}粪便发酵的时候 中间会变热 然后散发出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It just gets hot in the middle and comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's really hot in the middle. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 粪肥里面是热的? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you start bucketing that, it's gonna be boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把粪肥装进桶里时 它会沸腾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Start loading up, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始装粪吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One bucket weighs one tonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.44,0:22:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一挖斗重一吨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If that was artificial chemical fertiliser,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果是人工化肥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that would have cost me a thousand pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那得花我一千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The weigh scales is 1.6 tonne, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实称重秤显示...是1.6吨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got weigh scales in your new muck spreader?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的新施肥机上有称重秤?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:22:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:23:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它可先进了 你能知道你往土里撒了多少肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can actually tell how much muck's going on your fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what we need to know. The fertiliser price is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要知道 化肥价格太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're pretty much full now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在已经装得很满了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then that just flings it out over the field, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后这机器 就把粪扔到田地里 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's put it this way. I had a stone the other day go out 48 metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么说吧 前几天我扔了一块石头 扔出去了48米
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}48 metres out of the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从后面扔出去48米?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}48 metres out the back of this spreader,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从这个施肥机后面扔出去48米
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.40,0:23:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}through a window, through a blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.40,0:23:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}穿过窗户、遮光帘 撞到了椅子和冰箱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.04,0:23:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}hit a chair and hit a fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where? In Chadlington?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在哪儿?查德灵顿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, on Simon's field, in the middle of Chadlington.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 在查德灵顿中部的 西蒙的田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It hit the top of the chair and ripped all the leather off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}石头撞到了椅子的顶部 把所有皮革都撕掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So don't go behind your muck spreader then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以别跑到你的施肥机后面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then got a first-hand demonstration
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 在卡莱布兄弟给田地施肥时 我亲眼见证了这个施肥机的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of the muck spreader's Gatling-gun power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as Kaleb's brother fertilised the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“加特林机枪”的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus. Why don't they use that-- The Army should use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 他们为何不用那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}军队应该用那机器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Win a lot of wars with that, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定能用它赢下很多战争 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you loaded that up with gravel and then drove through a war zone...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你给它装满砂砾 然后开进战区...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You would literally... - You'd properly get people to duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你真的会...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你很可能会让人们躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was extremely happy to be using free fertiliser,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我非常高兴能使用免费的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but we only had enough to cover 25 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但其数量只够覆盖10公顷田地
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.84,0:24:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it was up to farm manager Kaleb to decide
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.84,0:24:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 需要农场经理卡莱布决定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.76,0:24:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}how many chemicals he'd need to fill in the gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.76,0:24:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要多少化肥来填补空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He therefore invited Charlie over to his new office.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 他邀请查理去他的新办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I've just been working this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚想通这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.28,0:24:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's "this"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.28,0:24:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“这个问题”是指?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The cropping. - I've done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 种植庄稼 - 我已经完成那一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but I'm doing it. 'Cause I'm farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但我会做决定 因为我是农场经理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, wha... Okay. Well, what's "your" plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯...好吧 你打算怎么种?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I think wheat down the right-hand side of the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.08,0:24:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得农场的右手边要种小麦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which I call the right-hand side, which is Big Ground Banks Airfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我说的右手边是一大片堤岸 飞机场
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The eastern side. - Yeah. Or that side, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}东边吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The eastern side. - Yeah. Okay. Right-hand side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 或者那边 没错 - 东边吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 好吧 右手边
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then spring wheat in basically the middle end of the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.12,0:25:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 春小麦种在农场的中间
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Okay. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you said-- Did you say about 100,000 pounds' worth of fertiliser?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.68,0:25:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说过...你是不是说过 价值约十万英镑的化肥?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Roughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毛估
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I can get it down to about 78,000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我可以降到78000英镑左右
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got the chicken muck, we've got the cow muck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有鸡粪 有牛粪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. So you're hoping that that cuts the amount of artificial nitrogen?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想用这些粪肥 来减少人工氮肥的用量?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.36,0:25:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - Don't be short on nitrogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.36,0:25:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 别因为控制成本就用氮过少
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And don't cut corners unnecessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不要舍本逐末
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The risk's gone through the roof. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为风险已经非常高了 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.48,0:25:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you've got higher growing costs, you've got higher pricing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.48,0:25:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - ...你的种植成本增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, we need the output to maximise our income,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}价格更高
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要保证收成来将收入最大化
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because that'll give you your profit at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为最终你要靠它获得利润
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we can save 22,000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们可以节省22000英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, let's hope it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希望能节省吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This farm competition... Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次农场竞赛...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you okay with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 你觉得还行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, the man can hardly farm the farmed, let alone farm the unfarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个男人...他连耕地都不太会种 更别提开发未耕地了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God knows what he's gonna... God knows his ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天知道他在干什么... 天知道他的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As they discussed this, I was busy in the barn,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当他们讨论此事时
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}working on another blackberry-harvesting solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在谷仓里忙着琢磨 另一种黑莓采摘方案
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I must say, I was rather pleased with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须说 我对此还算满意
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now, we move to the other side of the vehicle,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我们来到汽车的另一侧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where we find the vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吸尘器
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.48,0:26:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在这一侧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Simply apply the vacuum cleaner to the blackberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只需用吸尘器去吸黑莓
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.08,0:26:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好耶!谁能想到啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.72,0:26:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.36,0:26:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've done a thing that works!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.36,0:26:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的方法奏效了!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm harvesting a bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在采摘灌木丛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's only pulling off the black ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且它只会吸走成熟的黑莓 不会吸走未成熟的红色莓果
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.88,0:26:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's not pulling off the unripe red ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're not using CGI here. This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是电脑合成画面 是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.24,0:26:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:26:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what sort of vacuum cleaner this is, I'm not an expert,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:26:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道这是什么牌子的吸尘器 我可不是吸尘器专家 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.80,0:26:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but they're marketing it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.80,0:26:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的营销方向搞错了 看看收获
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that. Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五分钟 没有红果 太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.20,0:27:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're red ones. I'm staggered!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.88,0:27:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once I'd harvested the hedge...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.88,0:27:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一采摘完树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.00,0:27:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I headed to the farm kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.00,0:27:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就前往农场厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.16,0:27:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}leafed through Mrs Beeton's old cookery book...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.16,0:27:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我翻阅了比顿夫人以前的烹饪书...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.52,0:27:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blackberries, lemon juice, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.52,0:27:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黑莓、柠檬汁、糖
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.28,0:27:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then started to make some Diddly Squat blackberry jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.28,0:27:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...然后开始制作迪丽斯库阿特黑莓酱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woah. Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}妈呀!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So all I have to do is add the jam sugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我只需要加入果酱糖 还有柠檬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.80,0:27:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}add the lemon juice,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bubble them away for half an hour or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}高温加热半小时左右
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cool it, sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}冷却 然后销售
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.96,0:27:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One hour's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.96,0:27:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只需要一小时就能做好 需要一小时采摘 总共两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.80,0:27:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An hour to harvest them. Two hour's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is pure profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是纯利润
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.52,0:27:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.52,0:27:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing? - Making jam, dear boy. Making jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}亲爱的朋友 我在做果酱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:28:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is new farming, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:28:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是新农业
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Given that we weren't dealing with cows or crops,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到我们不养牛 也不种庄稼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I assumed there'd be no opportunity for finger-wagging.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们不会遭人否定
