Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the fruit in it's 443 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}加入水果后 重量为443克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So 215.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以是215克 - 差值是这么多吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that the difference? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 那么我们知道在每个罐子里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:06.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we know that in each jar, there will be 215 grams of fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有215克水果
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I wash this, it'll be all right to use again, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我把它洗干净 可以再次使用吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.04,0:32:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's the whole point of glass jars, Jeremy, you can reuse them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.04,0:32:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 玻璃罐 就是拿来重复使用的 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Exactly. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们可以重复使用 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do I have to sterilise it? - Yes, you do have to sterilise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得给它消毒吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你必须给它消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.04,0:32:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've been through that. Put it in a warm oven for ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.04,0:32:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经讨论过了 把它放进温热的烤箱里十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.16,0:32:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lid and jar sterilising.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.16,0:32:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}消毒盖子和罐子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.88,0:32:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, there's just nothing there. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.88,0:32:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那里什么都没有 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.88,0:32:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The oven's here. - Oh, right. What's this then?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.88,0:32:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 烤箱在这里 - 对哦 那这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Despite these minor setbacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管遇到了这些小挫折
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a couple of days later, my jam was ready to go on sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 我的果酱已经准备好出售了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's all those.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有果酱都在这里了 所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:32:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It cost nothing to plant the blackberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}种植黑莓一分钱都没花
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.72,0:33:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米果汁 迪丽斯库阿特黑莓酱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't have to fertilise them. I didn't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不必给它们施肥 我不必做任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.96,0:33:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eat your heart out, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.96,0:33:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就酸吧 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.40,0:33:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look what I have got for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.40,0:33:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看我给你带来了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No way! - Yes way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不可能吧 - 当然可能
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How much can we sell it for? - What would you like to charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一罐能卖多少钱? - 你想卖多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it cost 1.49 pounds to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个嘛 它的制作成本是1.49英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}60p for the jar, 47p for the label,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每罐的罐子60便士 标签47便士 糖42便士
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.12,0:33:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and 42p for the sugar in each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think 3.60 pounds is a reasonable amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得卖3.6英镑很合理
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I mean, I can sell it for 4.80. It's 3.60.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以卖到4.8英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.16,0:33:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not having any of your...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.16,0:33:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}3.6英镑 我不会采纳你所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well, hoo, we can get away with charging more."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们可以多收点钱” 就3.6英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}3.60.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As good as it was to see my jam on the shelves,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然看到我的果酱摆在货架上很好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew that my current sources of income from farming the unfarmed
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我知道我目前
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}would soon dry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.52,0:33:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在开发未耕地计划中获得收入的来源 很快就会枯竭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:33:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Autumn was now upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:34:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}秋天已经来临 这意味着蜜蜂即将停产
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.80,0:34:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant the bees would knock off for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.24,0:34:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the hedges would become bereft of fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.24,0:34:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}树篱将空无一物 果实尽失
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.88,0:34:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, I'd had another money-making brainwave
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.88,0:34:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 我有了另一个赚钱的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.68,0:34:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I couldn't wait to tell Charlie all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.68,0:34:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我迫不及待地想告诉查理了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.60,0:34:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a new thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.60,0:34:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有了一个新想法
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.16,0:34:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.16,0:34:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.16,0:34:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pigs. And there's method in my madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.16,0:34:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪 这个看似疯狂的想法暗藏玄机
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:30.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the Prime Minister speaking. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是首相讲话 准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.44,0:34:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In a fortnight I'm going to Paris
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.44,0:34:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两周后 我要去巴黎 参加世界上最大的食品博览会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.20,0:34:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for the world's largest food trade fair
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.80,0:34:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I will be bigging-up British products.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.80,0:34:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我将大力宣传英国产品
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In December, I'll be in Beijing, opening up new pork markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}十二月 我会去北京 开辟新的猪肉市场
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:51.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she paused there for applause that didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她停下来等待掌声 但没人鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.04,0:34:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I was paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.04,0:34:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she's opening up new pork markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以她要开辟新的猪肉市场 这话出自于一个女人...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is a woman who's... She's the Prime Minister, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她现在是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:35:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thousands and thousands of Conservative Party members have looked at her
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:35:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}成千上万的保守党成员看着她说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and said "She's wise, she's on it, she's bright, she's the right choice."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“她聪明过人 洞察一切 活力四射 是正确的选择”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she thinks there's going to be a burgeoning pork market in China. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果她认为能在中国 开启一个蓬勃发展的猪肉市场...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So do you want to breed pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你想养猪?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.80,0:35:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes! 'Cause then you get piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.80,0:35:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 因为这样你就能得到猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'd be fun to have little piglets running around... Won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让猪崽跑来跑去会很有趣 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It would be much easier from a management point of view...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从管理的角度 更简单的做法是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? - ...to just buy piglets in,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - ...直接买小猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fatten those up, and then kill them to sell in the farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们养肥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后把它们杀了 在农场商店售卖
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.16,0:35:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then you'd have to buy more. Why don't you just get them breeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.16,0:35:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但然后 你就得买更多猪 为什么不直接培育呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.76,0:35:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As soon as you've got a breeding pig, it's a 365 thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.76,0:35:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦你有了一头种猪 就得365天照顾它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Somebody's gotta be here every single day,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天都得有人在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.96,0:35:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}watering, feeding, moving, checking the welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.96,0:35:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喂水、喂食、赶猪 检查其健康状况
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.96,0:35:42.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I cannot believe pigs are complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.96,0:35:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}养猪居然这么麻烦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.52,0:35:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you have the babies, chop them up, sell them in the shop, sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.52,0:35:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就买小猪崽 然后养大杀了拿去商店里卖
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.52,0:35:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You get so much from a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.52,0:35:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做成香肠 猪的一身都是宝
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I just... you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我就...你从猪跳到了农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've jumped from pigs to the farm shop without,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得你没有全面考虑生产的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.16,0:35:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think, full consideration of the production bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.40,0:36:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Liz Truss says I can sell them in Beijing. She's opening up...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.40,0:36:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}莉兹特拉斯说我们可以 在北京卖猪肉 她在开辟市场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.68,0:36:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't want you to sell them in Beijing. Sell them at the farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.68,0:36:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我宁愿你在农场商店卖 也别去北京卖
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm gonna sell them in there. - Who's gonna look after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我要在那里卖猪肉 - 谁来照顾它们?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Me. - Every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我 - 每天?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.28,0:36:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. I'm here every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.28,0:36:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我每天都在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- When you're not here? - Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不在的时候呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.64,0:36:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Has he got enough time? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.64,0:36:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卡莱布 - 他有足够的时间吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Where are they gonna live? - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有 - 要养在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because Kaleb can't get the potatoes up, they go up into the...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个嘛 因为卡莱布无法收获土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就把它们养在... - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where the potatoes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...种土豆的地方 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.56,0:36:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.68,0:36:25.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We fence that bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.68,0:36:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们用栅栏把那块地圈起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yep. - They go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好 - 它们就待在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they'll eat all the potatoes, so we get value from the potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会吃掉所有土豆 这样我们种的土豆就能派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.28,0:36:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but they won't be there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.28,0:36:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但土豆是会吃完的 - 不 树林
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Woods. They're gonna be woodland pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会成为林地猪 我可以把它们放在树林里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.80,0:36:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can put them in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.00,0:36:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you know I've got that competition going with Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.00,0:36:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我在跟卡莱布比赛吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I told him I could generate money from the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟他说我可以靠树林赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- yes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.80,0:36:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I put pigs, once they've eaten all the potatoes out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.80,0:36:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等猪吃完所有卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- that he's failed to get up. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}种失败的土豆后
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.96,0:36:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They live in the woods, snouting around. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.96,0:36:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会把它们养在树林里... - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.84,0:36:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm making money from my side of the enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.84,0:36:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...在林间拱来拱去... - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.56,0:36:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...而我就会从我这方面赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because they can truffle about,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为猪能自己找松露
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and they just turn over the soil looking for acorns and things, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会翻土找橡子什么的 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.52,0:37:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In an idyllic sort of Winnie the Pooh world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.52,0:37:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太理想化了 就像《小熊维尼》里的世界一样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.44,0:37:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're foragers, but they're more like a JCB, they're earth movers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.44,0:37:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是觅食者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.60,0:37:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但它们更像是掘土机 重型推土机
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.80,0:37:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you will regenerate the woods into a sort of stock-car track.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.80,0:37:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你会把树林改造成赛车赛道的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'll have the local kids in there with their BMXs
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当地的孩子们 会骑着他们的越野自行车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cycling around these massive earthworks that they've created.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在它们建造的巨大土方工程周围骑行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your ne-- This is your most negative yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:20.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我... - 你差点...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.08,0:37:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是你迄今最消极的预测
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:25.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I am just concerned about the production of piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是担心猪崽的生产问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The idyllic nature of it in your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有你想象中的田园风光
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to get hundreds of them in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想在树林里养几百头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.32,0:37:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rootling around, clearing away the thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.32,0:37:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它们四处觅食 清理荆棘...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I, I, I... Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.16,0:37:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我...听着...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Actually, I'm gonna get on it now. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 我现在就会开始着手准备
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm going to find a pig farmer. I'm gonna get some pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会寻找养猪场... - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Piggly Squat Pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...然后买一些猪 猪丽斯库阿特猪肉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.36,0:37:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.36,0:37:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托!答应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.68,0:37:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.96,0:37:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As I set to work, with no help from Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.96,0:37:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我在没有查理帮忙的情况下 开始工作时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb took the Lambo in for a much-needed service...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布把这辆兰博基尼拖拉机 送去进行紧急维修
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.16,0:38:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then used his own toy tractor to work the fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.16,0:38:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后用他自己的玩具拖拉机 在田地里干活
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.84,0:38:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}whose walls were now looking a bit tired as Gerald was still feeling poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.84,0:38:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里的围墙看起来有点破败 因为杰拉德仍然身体不适
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.16,0:38:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then it was time for Kaleb and I to have a serious chat
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.16,0:38:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 卡莱布和我该认真讨论下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.96,0:38:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about how our competition was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.96,0:38:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们比赛的进展情况了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.32,0:38:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It looks horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.28,0:38:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Damsons in vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}伏特加里泡西洋李 泡几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.28,0:38:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leave it for a couple of months. And then, sell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.28,0:38:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卖掉这酒
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we can make our own vodka, according to Lisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以用这些黄金土豆自制伏特加
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.36,0:38:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So how mu... - With our potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much money's... - There?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 多少钱... - 这...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.92,0:38:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much money worth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.92,0:38:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那值多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three, four hundred quid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三四百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.68,0:38:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the future of farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.68,0:38:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是农业的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.32,0:38:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not a future. - Well, it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.32,0:38:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这不是未来 - 这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's gonna get someone drunk for one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会让人大醉一宿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You think one person could drink all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得一个人能喝完这么多?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think you could drink all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你能都喝完
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then discussed the bill for servicing the Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们讨论了 维修兰博基尼拖拉机的账单
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.84,0:38:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is it? - Well, there's a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.84,0:38:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么了? - 有很多款项
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.64,0:38:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, I mean, it's buggered. - Also... It's not buggered!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.64,0:38:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 它坏了 - 它没坏!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.28,0:39:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It is. It's time to get a new... - The brakes weren't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.28,0:39:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 坏了 该买辆新的了 - 刹车失灵了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just get a new one. What's the total?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 总共多少钱? - 你能把这些都加起来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.96,0:39:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could you add these up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}3,259,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}3259
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}1,543,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}1543
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}99 plus 410.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}99 加410
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.04,0:39:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.04,0:39:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总共是多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}5,300 pounds. - That's a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}5300英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很大一笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.36,0:39:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a lot. But, I mean, I'll get three or four years of...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.36,0:39:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是很大一笔钱 但我能用三到四年...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, take that off your margins. Because, I mean, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从你的利润里扣 因为 那...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not my margins. It's your farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不能从我的利润里扣 这是你的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.32,0:39:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're doing the agricultural bit. - All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.32,0:39:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你负责农业工作 这要从你的利润里扣
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.28,0:39:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is coming off yours. - I wanna sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.28,0:39:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我想把它卖了 - 你不能卖 那是我的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.12,0:39:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're not gonna sell it. It's my tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.64,0:39:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, listen, we're gonna have a chart of who's doing best.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.64,0:39:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 听我说 我们要做一张图表 看谁做得最好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.64,0:39:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}笔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.96,0:39:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So this is "Spent" and "Made". - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.96,0:39:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是花销和收入
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-230 pounds. Yes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}果酱 230英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.40,0:39:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}230 pounds' profit,
